      </p>
      <nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm" aria-label="Footer navigation">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-frost-500 hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors duration-150">
          Privacy
        </a>
        <a href="/cookies" class="text-frost-500 hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors duration-150">
